              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali ubo bwine bushiku bwalengele amakumi yabili na shine (24), muli uyo wine mweshi, ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli Hagai nakabili aliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kebe Serubabeli umulashi wa calo ca Yuda, ukuti ine nalaswa ntenshe umulu ne sonde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndewisha ifipuna fya shamfumu no konaula amaka ya shamfumu sha benafyalo. Nkapenuna amaceleta na bantu bene abendelapo, bakabalwe bakafwa, na bantu abendelapo bakalaipayana abene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali ubo bushiku, ine ne Yawe umwine wa fita nkakubuula iwe Serubabeli we mubomfi wandi, we mwana mwaume wakwa Shealitieli. Ala niwefye ine ne Yawe nsalile kabili ndi nokukucita kwati ni nindaminwe yandi iya cikatilo. Nine ne Yawe umwine wa fita nalanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
